    cml:operator "MUST HAVE" ;
    cml:logicSummary "The AER must have a common seal." ;
    cml:premiseText "(2) The AER:  (a) is a body corporate with perpetual succession; and  (b) must have a common seal; and  (c) may acquire, hold and dispose of real and personal property; and  (d) may sue and be sued in its corporate name." ;
