    cml:operator "<=>" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Significant effect on referral traffic" ;
    cml:premiseText "(c) the change is likely to have a significant effect on the referral traffic from the designated digital platform service to the covered news content of registered news businesses (considered as a whole) that the service makes available." ;
